{
  "_readme": [
    "Hand-compiled admin-1 rows used to seed the map before the national-statistics",
    "adapters in scripts/fetch_census/ are run.  Every row carries its own source and",
    "reference year, and a row is only present when a primary census publication",
    "supports it -- there are deliberately no interpolated or estimated values here.",
    "Anything absent from this file is emitted as an explicit gap marker by",
    "scripts/build_entities.py, never as a guess.",
    "When a fetch_census adapter runs, its output overrides these rows.",
    "'aliases' lists the boundary-file spellings a row also answers to; the join in scripts/build_entities.py tries the name, then the aliases, then a unique prefix match, and reports anything still unmatched."
  ],
